15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Very few production deployments name a cloud bucket as their CAS store\ndirectly. The read pattern of a build cache (many small objects, requested\nrepeatedly, in bursts) is exactly what object storage prices and latency are\nworst at. The shape that works is a local fast tier in front of a durable slow\ntier:"}]
